{"page":1,"totalPages":3,"perPage":6,"nextPage":2,"html":"<li>\n  <article class=\"trailer\">\n    <div class=\"trailer-media\">\n      <img class=\"trailer-media-blur\" src=\"/images/solar-eclipses-app.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n        <img class=\"trailer-media-img\" src=\"/images/solar-eclipses-app.png\" alt=\"Screenshot of the solar eclipse visualization app\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n      <span class=\"trailer-cat\">Blog</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"trailer-body\">\n      <p class=\"trailer-meta\">\n        <time datetime=\"2026-03-22T00:00:00.000Z\">2026.03.22</time>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span>1 min read</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 class=\"trailer-title\"><a href=\"/blog/solar-eclipses\">Visualizing solar eclipses</a></h3>\n      <p class=\"trailer-text\">A total eclipse is a cosmic coincidence: a moon that just barely covers the sun. This app lets you move through the Sun, Moon and Earth system and watch the geometry that decides which patch of the planet falls into shadow.</p>\n      <ul class=\"trailer-tags\"><li>Javascript</li><li>Visualization</li><li>Astronomy</li></ul>\n      <span class=\"trailer-cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Read article</span>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <article class=\"trailer\">\n    <div class=\"trailer-media\">\n      <img class=\"trailer-media-blur\" src=\"/images/task-management-app.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n        <img class=\"trailer-media-img\" src=\"/images/task-management-app.png\" alt=\"Screenshot of the task management board\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n      <span class=\"trailer-cat\">Blog</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"trailer-body\">\n      <p class=\"trailer-meta\">\n        <time datetime=\"2026-03-22T00:00:00.000Z\">2026.03.22</time>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span>1 min read</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 class=\"trailer-title\"><a href=\"/blog/task-management\">Task management app</a></h3>\n      <p class=\"trailer-text\">A lightweight, visual task board that runs entirely in the browser. Move work between columns, track what is in flight, and keep day-to-day planning low friction: no backend, no account, nothing to sync.</p>\n      <ul class=\"trailer-tags\"><li>Javascript</li><li>React</li><li>Productivity</li></ul>\n      <span class=\"trailer-cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Read article</span>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <article class=\"trailer\">\n    <div class=\"trailer-media\">\n      <img class=\"trailer-media-blur\" src=\"/images/Balanced%20tree%20screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n        <img class=\"trailer-media-img\" src=\"/images/Balanced%20tree%20screenshot.webp\" alt=\"Animated balanced binary tree with labelled nodes\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n      <span class=\"trailer-cat\">Blog</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"trailer-body\">\n      <p class=\"trailer-meta\">\n        <time datetime=\"2020-04-09T00:00:00.000Z\">2020.04.09</time>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span>1 min read</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 class=\"trailer-title\"><a href=\"/blog/balanced-tree\">Balanced binary tree animated</a></h3>\n      <p class=\"trailer-text\">Balanced binary trees promise fast inserts, finds and deletes, and rotations are what keep the promise: they stop the tree from growing lopsided. Add and remove nodes here and watch each rotation play out one step at a time.</p>\n      <ul class=\"trailer-tags\"><li>Javascript</li><li>CSS</li><li>Balanced Binary Tree</li></ul>\n      <span class=\"trailer-cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Read article</span>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <article class=\"trailer\">\n    <div class=\"trailer-media\">\n      <img class=\"trailer-media-blur\" src=\"/images/Minesweeper%20screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n        <img class=\"trailer-media-img\" src=\"/images/Minesweeper%20screenshot.webp\" alt=\"Minesweeper board mid-game with a seven-segment counter\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n      <span class=\"trailer-cat\">Blog</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"trailer-body\">\n      <p class=\"trailer-meta\">\n        <time datetime=\"2020-02-18T00:00:00.000Z\">2020.02.18</time>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span>1 min read</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 class=\"trailer-title\"><a href=\"/blog/minesweeper\">Minesweeper</a></h3>\n      <p class=\"trailer-text\">The classic sweep-for-mines game, rebuilt with React and plain CSS on top of a flood fill that opens up the empty regions. Same nerve-wracking first click, now with a seven-segment timer counting against you.</p>\n      <ul class=\"trailer-tags\"><li>Minesweeper</li></ul>\n      <span class=\"trailer-cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Read article</span>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <article class=\"trailer\">\n    <div class=\"trailer-media\">\n      <img class=\"trailer-media-blur\" src=\"/images/Todo%20list%20screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n        <img class=\"trailer-media-img\" src=\"/images/Todo%20list%20screenshot.webp\" alt=\"Todo list app with several completed and pending items\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n      <span class=\"trailer-cat\">Blog</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"trailer-body\">\n      <p class=\"trailer-meta\">\n        <time datetime=\"2020-01-26T00:00:00.000Z\">2020.01.26</time>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span>1 min read</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 class=\"trailer-title\"><a href=\"/blog/reacttodolist\">Todo list with React and LocalStorage</a></h3>\n      <p class=\"trailer-text\">A todo list that lives entirely in your browser: React for the interface, localStorage for memory. Close the tab, come back next week, and the list is exactly where you left it.</p>\n      <ul class=\"trailer-tags\"><li>Javascript</li><li>React</li><li>CSS</li></ul>\n      <span class=\"trailer-cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Read article</span>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <article class=\"trailer\">\n    <div class=\"trailer-media\">\n      <img class=\"trailer-media-blur\" src=\"/images/Sudoku%20solver%20screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n        <img class=\"trailer-media-img\" src=\"/images/Sudoku%20solver%20screenshot.webp\" alt=\"Sudoku grid being solved in the browser\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n      <span class=\"trailer-cat\">Blog</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"trailer-body\">\n      <p class=\"trailer-meta\">\n        <time datetime=\"2017-07-02T00:00:00.000Z\">2017.07.02</time>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span>1 min read</span>\n      </p>\n      <h3 class=\"trailer-title\"><a href=\"/blog/sudokusolver\">Sudoku solver</a></h3>\n      <p class=\"trailer-text\">A randomized constraint solver for Sudoku, ported from Python to JavaScript so it runs as you watch. Hand it a puzzle with more than one solution and it will cheerfully give you a different answer each time.</p>\n      <ul class=\"trailer-tags\"><li>Sudoku</li><li>Computing</li></ul>\n      <span class=\"trailer-cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Read article</span>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</li>"}